## Fase 2 — Akses untuk User WiFi "retr"
- Staf gabung WiFi **"retr"** → buka `http://PCHOTSPOT_LAN_IP:3000` (atau `http://HOST_IP:3000` jika tidak pakai relay).
- Verifikasi: `Test-NetConnection -ComputerName <alamat> -Port 3000` → `True`.

---

## Fase 3 — Akses untuk User LAN (relay via PC Hotspot)
Hanya perlu bila ingin melayani user yang di LAN kabel (bukan di WiFi "retr").

### 3.1 Cari `PCHOTSPOT_LAN_IP`
Di mesin pc hotspot: `ipconfig` → adapter **Ethernet/LAN** (bukan `192.168.137.1`) → IPv4.

### 3.2 Port forwarding (di mesin PC HOTSPOT, PowerShell admin)
```powershell
netsh interface portproxy add v4tov4 listenport=3000 listenaddress=0.0.0.0 connectport=3000 connectaddress=192.168.137.67
netsh interface portproxy show all          # cek
# hapus: netsh interface portproxy delete v4tov4 listenport=3000 listenaddress=0.0.0.0
```
- Prasyarat: service **IP Helper** (`iphlpsvc`) berjalan (`Get-Service iphlpsvc`).

### 3.3 Firewall pc hotspot — izinkan TCP 3000
```powershell
New-NetFirewallRule -DisplayName "Pungoe Relay 3000" -Direction Inbound -Protocol TCP -LocalPort 3000 -Action Allow
```

### 3.4 Aturan URL tunggal
Semua user (LAN & WiFi) akses `http://PCHOTSPOT_LAN_IP:3000`, dan `NEXTAUTH_URL` = alamat itu.
- User LAN → langsung.
- User WiFi → juga bisa (arah WiFi→LAN diizinkan NAT).

> ⚠️ Dua IP bergerak: `192.168.137.67` (target relay — IP WiFi PC Host, bisa berubah → update `netsh portproxy`) dan `PCHOTSPOT_LAN_IP` (entry + `NEXTAUTH_URL` — lebih stabil bila LAN pakai IP statik/reservasi).

